    "turn_text": "I really try to listen to people. I try to meet them where they are, hear them out, and then understand where they are on that issue, and then begin to build support for what would be a long-term solution to whatever the issue is. And I've done that really. We've seen some great results by working, listening to people, working with parents and addressing the issues on social media.",
